  "plain": "In 2025 NASA, the US space agency, held a press conference about 3I/ATLAS, an object passing through our solar system from somewhere outside it. A podcast host, Jesse Michels, calls it an idiotic press conference about manipulation, and he points to the views of an astronomer, Avi Loeb. In Michels's framing, it is a sign that NASA is not being open about what such objects might be."
